# Images & Media

## Storefront ratios

| Surface | Aspect | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Product cards | 1:1 or 4:5 | Real product/context; warm light |
| Blog thumbs | 16:9 | |
| Hero | Full-bleed crop | One LCP `priority` image max |

```tsx
// ✅ sized parent prevents CLS; GiftImage picks web/thumb + LQIP
<div className="relative aspect-square">
  <GiftImage src={url} alt={`${name} gift`} fill sizes="(max-width:768px) 50vw, 25vw" />
</div>
```

- Empty `alt` only when decorative.
- No abstract purple-gradient “product” heroes.
- One LCP `priority` image max (`GiftImage` emits the preload). PLP/cards stay lazy.

## Platform

| Store | Holds |
|---|---|
| S3-compatible | Original + `*-web.webp` + `*-thumb.webp` bytes |
| Postgres | Metadata, keys, dimensions, MIME, tiny `blurDataUrl` — **not** full BYTEA |

- Validate MIME + size at upload; reject executables/polyglots.
- Raster uploads enqueue BullMQ `media-variants` (1600 web / 400 thumb / LQIP). GIF/SVG/PDF skipped.
- Public bytes: `GET /api/v1/media/:id/content?v=web|thumb|original` (web/thumb when READY).
- Private assets → **signed URLs** with expiry (never permanent public ACL for private).

## Don't

Hotlink unsigned private objects from the browser. Ship unsized `<img>` that shove layout. Transform on the request path (use the worker).
